IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0024.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY INT0024C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 INTEREST-RATE      PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INTEREST-RATE=" INTEREST-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
    IF DEPOSIT-BAND-1-6
        MOVE 0.0275 TO INTEREST-RATE
    ELSE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        IF DEPOSIT-BAND-7-18
            MOVE 0.0350 TO INTEREST-RATE
        ELSE
            *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
            IF DEPOSIT-BAND-19-60
                MOVE 0.0425 TO INTEREST-RATE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0200 TO INTEREST-RATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
